      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "seed": 3002,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 4002,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1757059200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RING-24 — two wheels, one rim\n\nKIS cube wheel        8 teeth (s mod 8)\nHYPERBOLIC axis       3 teeth (s mod 3)\n24 = 8×3 · gcd(8,3)=1\n→ CRT bijection s ↦ (s%8, s%3) on Z24\n\nsplit (6,4) / (12,2): lcm=12 < 24\n= FENCE — forbidden for addressing\n\nfg_crt:  s = dc + 8·k\nk ≡ (dx−dc)·2 (mod 3)  ·  s ∈ [0,24)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "RING-24 — two wheels, one rim\n\nKIS cube wheel        8 teeth (s mod 8)\nHYPERBOLIC axis       3 teeth (s mod 3)\n24 = 8×3 · gcd(8,3)=1\n→ CRT bijection s ↦ (s%8, s%3) on Z24\n\nsplit (6,4) / (12,2): lcm=12 < 24\n= FENCE — forbidden for addressing\n\nfg_crt:  s = dc + 8·k\nk ≡ (dx−dc)·2 (mod 3)  ·  s ∈ [0,24)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "event",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 120,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 240,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffd43b",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "seed": 3003,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 4003,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1757059200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "★ GEAR EVENT — replaces 16 b {from,to}\n\nΔ = (to − from + 144) % 144\nΔ = 24·q + r\n\nFREE = { q:3b | dc:3b | dx:2b }\n     = 8 b/event\nRIM  = { q:3b }  = 3 b/event\n  (every Δ ≡ 0 mod 24 → header 1 b)\n\ndc = r % 8  (cube wheel)\ndx = r % 3  (axis wheel)\nHOME tooth Δ=0 → emits nothing",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "★ GEAR EVENT — replaces 16 b {from,to}\n\nΔ = (to − from + 144) % 144\nΔ = 24·q + r\n\nFREE = { q:3b | dc:3b | dx:2b }\n     = 8 b/event\nRIM  = { q:3b }  = 3 b/event\n  (every Δ ≡ 0 mod 24 → header 1 b)\n\ndc = r % 8  (cube wheel)\ndx = r % 3  (axis wheel)\nHOME tooth Δ=0 → emits nothing",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wire",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 850,
      "y": 120,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 240,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "seed": 3004,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 4004,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1757059200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ENTER ANYWHERE — KIS doctrine\n\nwire stores Δ only — NO absolute seed\nreader holds its OWN cur_w, then\nfg_reconstruct() walks BACKWARD:\n  out[i] = (out[i+1] − Δ[i+1]) % 144\n\nlossless from ANY entry point\nreplay forward reproduces every\nintermediate scale exactly\n\nSEAL 0xFF = chain terminator\n(unreachable: bit7 always 0)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ENTER ANYWHERE — KIS doctrine\n\nwire stores Δ only — NO absolute seed\nreader holds its OWN cur_w, then\nfg_reconstruct() walks BACKWARD:\n  out[i] = (out[i+1] − Δ[i+1]) % 144\n\nlossless from ANY entry point\nreplay forward reproduces every\nintermediate scale exactly\n\nSEAL 0xFF = chain terminator\n(unreachable: bit7 always 0)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
