      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "BIT LAYOUT — little-endian on disk\n\nFREE (8 b/event):\n    7   6 5 4   3 2 1 0          Δ = q×24 + CRT(dc,dx)\n  ┌───┬───────┬───────┐          header 1 b declares RIM mode\n  │ dx│  dc   │   q   │\n  │ 2b│  3b   │  3b   │          RIM (3 b): {q} — all Δ ≡ 0 (mod 24)\n  └───┴───────┴───────┘\n\nFGF2 full field (20736): q:10b → FREE 15 b/event (vs 28 b {from,to} baseline = 53.6%)\n· RIM 10 b (35.7%) · SEAL 0xFF unreachable (bit7 always 0)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "BIT LAYOUT — little-endian on disk\n\nFREE (8 b/event):\n    7   6 5 4   3 2 1 0          Δ = q×24 + CRT(dc,dx)\n  ┌───┬───────┬───────┐          header 1 b declares RIM mode\n  │ dx│  dc   │   q   │\n  │ 2b│  3b   │  3b   │          RIM (3 b): {q} — all Δ ≡ 0 (mod 24)\n  └───┴───────┴───────┘\n\nFGF2 full field (20736): q:10b → FREE 15 b/event (vs 28 b {from,to} baseline = 53.6%)\n· RIM 10 b (35.7%) · SEAL 0xFF unreachable (bit7 always 0)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
